      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_5353d594baa577fe_2",
        "edit": "Fix the case statement in the always block: the four case items all used the same selector value 2'b00, so only the last assignment (out <= d) was reachable and out never reflected a, b, or c. Change the case item labels to the distinct values 2'b00, 2'b01, 2'b10, 2'b11 so each selector value drives the corresponding input.",
